{
  "_comment": "MIDI keyboard as one articulation: the housing on a free joint, every key and control on its own joint, and four rubber feet hard-jointed under the housing. The actor transform turns the CAD layout (players' side at -Y) so the keys face +X, centered on the origin. Return springs are constraints. Generated from the CAD layout and tuned with superdex_asset_tuner (see tuning/).",
